<title>HONG KONG: HK Land Auction - Stanley site fetches HK$5.5 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Land Auction - Stanley site fetches HK$5.5 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 571,848 square foot site in beachside Stanley on southern Hong Kong island sold for HK$5.5 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bidding for the plot of land opened at HK$5.2 billion and analysts had expected it to fetch between HK$6.4 billion to HK$7.3 billion.  </p>
<p>Market sources identified the winning bidders as China Overseas Land and Investment Ltd and Paliburg Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843-6345  http://www.hk97.com</p>
